/build/
local.properties
# pubspec.lock is deliberately NOT ignored, unlike upstream. This is an
# application, not a library: Dart's own guidance is that applications commit
# their lockfile. Without it every CI run, Docker build and tagged release
# re-resolves from constraints, so a transitive package publishing a new
# version can change a build with no commit in this repository -- which makes a
# release unreproducible by construction.

